Notices for elk-lean (npm package)

elk-lean is a pure Lean 4 port of the Eclipse Layout Kernel (ELK). This package
provides an elkjs-compatible JavaScript API over the elk-lean engine (native
Node.js addon, WASM fallback).

  ELK project home: https://projects.eclipse.org/projects/modeling.elk

